### Create service request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/service-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Database connection issue",
  "description": "Unable to connect to production database",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Get service request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/service-requests/1

### Update Service Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/service-requests/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Database connection issue - resolved",
  "description": "Database connectivity has been restored",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### Delete Service Request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/service-requests/1